  "description": "PageProbe is a modern, extensible .NET 8 web crawling library for extracting links, multimedia, metadata, images, and text from web pages. It supports robust crawling with depth control, robots.txt compliance, and export to multiple formats (CSV, JSON, XML, Markdown, Text). Designed for reliability, testability, and easy integration in .NET applications.",
